  <name>Rosi</name>
  <summary>A cross-platform GUI for yt-dlp</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      ROSI is a modern Electron-based GUI for yt-dlp, making it easy to
      download videos from the web with a clean, intuitive interface.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Download videos and audio from supported sites</li>
      <li>Bundled FFmpeg for format conversion</li>
      <li>GPU-accelerated encoding (NVIDIA, AMD, Intel)</li>
      <li>Advanced format selection</li>
      <li>Audio-only download mode</li>
      <li>Post-download conversion to MP4, MOV, MP3, M4A</li>
      <li>Browser cookie integration</li>
      <li>Beautiful themed interface with multiple themes</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
